{
 "lang": "en",
 "duration": 109.9943125,
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.98,
   "text": "Most people assume that happiness and unhappiness are opposites."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.02,
   "end": 6.24,
   "text": "If you have more of one, you have less of the other."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.42,
   "end": 7.98,
   "text": "It's on a dial, basically."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.18,
   "end": 9.04,
   "text": "But that's wrong."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.28,
   "end": 12.14,
   "text": "In truth, happiness and unhappiness are separate systems."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.66,
   "end": 16.1,
   "text": "Researchers confirmed this in 1988 with a tool called PANAS,"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.3,
   "end": 19.1,
   "text": "the Positive and Negative Affect Schedule."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.32,
   "end": 21.12,
   "text": "You get two independent scores."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.48,
   "end": 23.5,
   "text": "Your positive affect and your negative affect."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.56,
   "end": 24.8,
   "text": "You can run high on both."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.9,
   "end": 26.16,
   "text": "You can run low on both."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.32,
   "end": 29.52,
   "text": "Most people have spent their entire lives trying to manage one dial."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.52,
   "end": 33.04,
   "text": "They didn't know they had and completely ignoring the other."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.18,
   "end": 35.24,
   "text": "Mother Nature built it this way on purpose."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.5,
   "end": 37.76,
   "text": "Negative emotions are a survival system."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.0,
   "end": 39.66,
   "text": "They keep you scanning for threats."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.82,
   "end": 42.2,
   "text": "Positive emotions push you toward opportunity."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.44,
   "end": 43.58,
   "text": "Those are two different systems."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.96,
   "end": 46.1,
   "text": "The ancients understood this intuitively."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.86,
   "end": 50.06,
   "text": "Ecclesiastes speaks of a time to weep and a time to laugh,"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.12,
   "end": 51.92,
   "text": "both belonging to a full life."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.2,
   "end": 54.72,
   "text": "My negative dial runs pretty hot."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.86,
   "end": 57.44,
   "text": "For years, I assumed that meant something was wrong with me."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.56,
   "end": 58.34,
   "text": "But it doesn't."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.34,
   "end": 61.3,
   "text": "It means I have a specific setting and it's not a malfunction."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.72,
   "end": 65.2,
   "text": "And knowing that changed what I was actually working on day to day."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.64,
   "end": 67.92,
   "text": "I stopped trying to manufacture cheerfulness."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.34,
   "end": 72.78,
   "text": "And I started managing the negative dial through sleep, exercise, and food."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.86,
   "end": 75.64,
   "text": "Not turning it to zero, but managing it."
  },
  {
   "start": 75.74,
   "end": 78.88,
   "text": "That's the unglamorous machinery of a good life."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.0,
   "end": 81.24,
   "text": "The wellness industry will sell you the idea"
  },
  {
   "start": 81.24,
   "end": 84.28,
   "text": "that feeling better and feeling less bad are the same project."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.36,
   "end": 85.68,
   "text": "They're not the same project."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.68,
   "end": 88.76,
   "text": "And if you try to eliminate your unhappiness entirely,"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.1,
   "end": 91.34,
   "text": "you will eliminate your happiness with it."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.48,
   "end": 94.96,
   "text": "So the first step is knowing your positive and negative affect numbers."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.18,
   "end": 98.96,
   "text": "Not to fix them, to understand what you're exactly working with,"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.1,
   "end": 100.78,
   "text": "and to make the correct changes."
  },
  {
   "start": 101.18,
   "end": 103.82,
   "text": "You can't be happy, but you can be happier,"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.32,
   "end": 105.98,
   "text": "but not by turning the wrong dial."
  }
 ],
